# Adamant Will: "Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains indestructible until end of turn." Bot2 casts Infernal Grasp on Bot1's
# Isamaru (a 2/2) on turn 2; Bot1 responds with Adamant Will on it. The Will resolves first: Isamaru is a 4/4 with indestructible
# (CR 702.12b) and when Infernal Grasp resolves its "destroy" does nothing, so Isamaru stays (Bot2 still loses 2 life).
# On turn 3 the effects have ended at the cleanup step (CR 514.2): a 2/2 with no keyword.

